#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_hr
msgid "\n                Camp HR manager — can add and edit staff certifications\n                (KRK, RPS, course certs). PL law: Rozp. MEN 2016 §4.\n            "
msgstr "\n                HR-менеджер табору — може add and edit сертифікати персоналу\n                (KRK, RPS, сертифікати курсів). PL закон: Rozp. MEN 2016 §4.\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_leader
msgid "\n                Camp leader — extends Kierownik with sign-off rights:\n                can invoke sign_qualification() and complete_section_iii()\n                on camp.participant. Required by PL law (Rozp. MEN 2016 §5).\n            "
msgstr "\n                Лідер табору — extends Kierownik з sign-off rights:\n                може invoke sign_qualification() and complete_section_iii()\n                on camp.participant. Вимагається PL закон (Rozp. MEN 2016 §5).\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_fayna_camp_manager
msgid "\n                Camp manager — full access to camp.program (Program Wypoczynku,\n                Załącznik 9) including approve/submit workflow. Can override\n                immutability where PL law permits (incident post-closure edits).\n            "
msgstr "\n                Менеджер табору — повний доступ до camp.program (Program Wypoczynku,\n                Załącznik 9) including approve/submit workflow. Coverride\n                immutability where PL закон permits (incident post-closure edits).\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_admin
msgid "\n                Camp operations admin — full access to camp.report including\n                revert-to-draft on submitted reports. Implied by camp_manager.\n            "
msgstr "\n                Адмін операцій табору — повний доступ до camp.report including\n                revert-до-draft on submitted reports. Implied by camp_manager.\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_emergency_manager
msgid "\n                Emergency manager — full access to incident lifecycle including\n                close, reopen, and override state. Immutable ledger enforcement\n                applies post-close (BP-006, Ustawa Kamilka 2024).\n            "
msgstr "\n                Менеджер НС — повний доступ до цикл інциденту including\n                close, reopen, and override state. Immutable ledger enдляcement\n                applies post-close (BP-006, UstawKamilk2024).\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_emergency_responder
msgid "\n                First-responder — can create/update camp.incident reports and\n                camp.incident.action entries. Cannot close or reopen incidents.\n                Required by BP-006 SLA (10s first action trigger).\n            "
msgstr "\n                Першочерговий респондер — може створювати/оновлювати camp.incident звіти and\n                camp.incident.action entries. Не може закривати або відкривати incidents.\n                Вимагається BP-006 SL(10s first action trigger).\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_instructor
msgid "\n                Instructor — specialist for one or more activities (swimming,\n                climbing, archery). Sees own activities via record rule\n                camp.activity.responsible_id == self. Sees only attendees with\n                relevant medical info (e.g., asthma for running).\n            "
msgstr "\n                Instrucдоr — specialist для one or more activities (swimming,\n                climbing, archery). Бачить власні activities через record rule\n                camp.activity.responsible_id == self. Sees тільки attendees з\n                релевантні медичні info (e.g., asthmдля running).\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_kierownik
msgid "\n                Kierownik (camp shift director) — can create/edit camp.journal,\n                camp.daily.report, camp.staff entries. Cannot approve Załącznik 9\n                (that requires group_fayna_camp_manager).\n            "
msgstr "\n                Kierownik (camp shift direcдоr) — може створювати/редагувати camp.journal,\n                camp.daily.report, camp.staff entries. Cannot approve Załącznik 9\n                (that requires group_fayna_camp_manager).\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_medical_officer
msgid "\n                Medical officer — read/write access to RODO Art.9 special-category\n                health fields: allergies, medications, chronic_conditions, doctor_notes\n                on camp.participant. Requires signed DPA with organizer.\n            "
msgstr "\n                Medical officer — доступ читання/запису до RODO ст.9 special-category\n                health fields: allergies, medications, chronic_conditions, docдоr_notes\n                on camp.participant. Requires signed DPз organizer.\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_nutrition_officer
msgid "\n                Nutrition officer — read/write access to dietary and allergen data\n                on camp.participant.diet (RODO Art.9 special-category data).\n                EU Regulation 1169/2011 (14 major allergens).\n            "
msgstr "\n                Nutrition officer — доступ читання/запису до dietary and allergen data\n                on camp.participant.diet (RODO ст.9 special-category data).\n                EU Regulation 1169/2011 (14 major allergens).\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_organizator
msgid "\n                Organizator Wypoczynku per PL law (Rozp. MEN 30.03.2016 §2.1).\n                Legal person/entity (foundation, scout org, company) registered\n                with Kuratorium Oświaty. Bypasses all record rules (via\n                base.group_system), lands on /admin/dashboard, can\n                /admin/as-{role} impersonate any role. Each impersonation\n                logged in camp.admin.access.log (RODO art.30, 7-year retention).\n            "
msgstr "\n                Організатор Wypoczynku per PL закон (Rozp. MEN 30.03.2016 §2.1).\n                Legal person/entity (foundation, scout org, compбудь-який) registered\n                з Kuraдоrium Oświaty. Обходить всі record rules (via\n                base.group_system), переходить на /admin/dashboard, може\n                /admin/as-{role} impersonate будь-яка роль. Кожне переключення ролі\n                залоговано в camp.admin.access.log (RODO ст.30, 7-year збереження).\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_sales
msgid "\n                Sales/marketing manager — catalog, prices, sale.order, support\n                requests, marketing reports, public stories. NO access to medical\n                data, kuratorium, dziennik, daily reports, incidents.\n            "
msgstr "\n                Sales/marketing manager — catalog, prices, sale.order, support\n                requests, marketing reports, public sдоries. NO access до medical\n                data, kuraдоrium, dziennik, daily reports, incidents.\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_wychowawca
msgid "\n                Wychowawca — runs activities for own group of children. Sees own\n                group only via record rule camp.staff.event_id == self. Sees\n                allergies + emergency_contact (children) but NOT medications/\n                doctor_notes. Załącznik 5 MEN dziennik signing rights.\n            "
msgstr "\n                Wychowawc— runs activities для own group of children. Бачить власні\n                group тільки через record rule camp.staff.event_id == self. Sees\n                allergies + emergency_contact (children) but NOT medications/\n                docдоr_notes. Załącznik 5 MEN права підпису dziennik.\n            "

